{
  "id": "npc_jinwanguan",
  "title": "金万贯对话",
  "description": "水乡商会掌柜金万贯的日常对话",
  "start_node": "greeting",
  "metadata": {
    "npc_id": "jinwanguan",
    "npc_name": "金万贯",
    "location": "江南水乡商会"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greeting",
      "speaker": "jinwanguan",
      "text": "哎哟，贵客临门！金某这商会里，南货北货、灵材丹药，没有买不到，只有想不到。客官随便看，看上什么，价钱好商量！",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_business",
          "text": "掌柜的生意经可否赐教？",
          "next_node": "business_talk"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_goods",
          "text": "最近可有什么稀罕货？",
          "next_node": "goods_talk",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": "jinwanguan",
              "value": 10,
              "operator": ">="
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_leave",
          "text": "先逛逛，告辞",
          "next_node": "farewell"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "business_talk",
      "speaker": "jinwanguan",
      "text": "哈哈，赐教不敢当！金某做生意就八个字：「人弃我取，人取我予」。旁人都抢灵丹妙药的时候，我囤桐油石灰；旁人回过神来，嘿，价钱就翻上去喽！",
      "emotion": "confident",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "jinwanguan",
          "value": 3,
          "reason": "请教生意经"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "farewell"
    },
    {
      "id": "goods_talk",
      "speaker": "jinwanguan",
      "text": "客官是自己人，金某就透个底——前两日来了个戴斗笠的游商，出手几件玩意儿，连金某都瞧不出门道。那才叫真正的稀罕货！只可惜人家收的是灵石，还挑买家。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "jinwanguan",
          "value": 5,
          "reason": "打探稀罕货源"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "farewell"
    },
    {
      "id": "farewell",
      "speaker": "jinwanguan",
      "text": "客官慢走！买卖不成仁义在，下回给您算便宜些！",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "is_end": true
    }
  ]
}
